From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gateway maintainers <gateway@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 17:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Recover neighbor links with bounded bootstrap and route retries

Coalesce jittered replies to complete empty link-status advertisements.
Retry queued discoveries once on recovery without extending their deadlines,
and kick concentrator advertisements through their existing rate limiter.

---
